</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1e944cd6-84df-11f1-80b0-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2NT88R.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1e944cd6-84df-11f1-80b0-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2NT88R.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">4c3cfa30-84d9-11f1-b6db-db2ffabab7f1</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 19:07:02 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1e944cd6-84df-11f1-80b0-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2NT88R.jpg">© AFP - DIMITAR DILKOFF </source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>France and Germany move to tackle EU’s growing trade deficit with China</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260721-france-and-germany-move-to-tackle-eu-s-growing-trade-deficit-with-china</link><description>
France and Germany are pressing for a stronger European Union response to China’s growing trade surplus and industrial overcapacity, as concerns mount over the impact on key European sectors.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee530872-8205-11f1-bfc5-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26198483233993.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee530872-8205-11f1-bfc5-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26198483233993.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">f2d0d434-842f-11f1-944b-131eff2948d7</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 06:08:04 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/ee530872-8205-11f1-bfc5-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26198483233993.jpg">Oliver Berg/DPA via AP - Oliver Berg</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Ukraine’s wartime unity put to the test by protests over military leadership</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260721-ukraine-s-wartime-unity-put-to-the-test-by-protests-over-military-leadership</link><description>
Protests over the dismissal of Ukraine’s reformist defence minister entered a fifth day on Monday, deepening a political crisis that has placed President Volodymyr Zelensky under mounting pressure to overhaul the country’s military leadership.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a11172da-84ce-11f1-bc50-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2PE3ZQ.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a11172da-84ce-11f1-bc50-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2PE3ZQ.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b2dc5c6e-84ce-11f1-abed-cba796d7c824</guid><pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 07:33:15 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a11172da-84ce-11f1-bc50-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C2PE3ZQ.jpg">AFP - GENYA SAVILOV</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>Spotlight on Africa</category><title>Countdown to the ballot: Zambia gears up for August elections</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/podcasts/spotlight-on-africa/20260721-countdown-to-the-ballot-zambia-gears-up-for-august-elections</link><description>
